#: scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01014d16f425ea537d779b2298211740ec8121b3c28efdbd99eee17b7b2d4598
#. default-sha256: 397173971a8b814b3ce84005ea9731043fae603748e815bbface783e0aa658ce
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫As you "
"know, I am not from this land."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Come sai, "
"non sono di questo Paese."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a17ccd796686c125a02d4b074a2e6a3b62f1a8f1dc3eab78503da0d69547a0a3
#. default-sha256: 0c19b11f75149488ab9b5c37127c897fba245c75c665f4d48b590df35d75932e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The issue is,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A dir la verità,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a14b2b136a5c2a22dc8a2f19d810bf23ed650a2726cd0d44e71117a5bd1f955
#. default-sha256: a068e285041317013e2a8d726691ad5f9acd58367845904270286cdae8982e53
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know any more about where I came from than you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫non so da dove vengo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2d2c19ceca725b05b0d7a958ea926d197fed0d9c3303aa2830eb86fc854c44f
#. default-sha256: aa50d1c698cdbc80f82b5775a9139c0b95227b853e0178c16b7e84143579eb90
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫most of my memories are gone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫quasi tutti i miei ricordi sono svaniti."

#: scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5335337a2e562d7f85beff55d3f1bb47fbeed9a6a78da8ec4c7c2ac286e153b1
#. default-sha256: 9b2f4ba0ef4eb6289f385f73b7999baa9caabed3b68d9c0a46e48174407d673c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or perhaps a messenger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Credo di aver fatto parte di una carovana... ⟪k:1⟫o forse ero un messaggero."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6efe3080252c5ecd1c91701f863c83b1335e3ff82f8d8411db479eda34e3cfe4
#. default-sha256: 36d162052b694e602c111e5bc7f4d3858d68d82de177d5eec21796efeafade44
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I vaguely remember being waylaid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We were vastly outnumbered, massacred with little "
"resistance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or at least, I assume that’s what happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ricordo vagamente che venimmo attaccati.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eravamo in netta inferiorità numerica, e "
"fummo massacrati con poca resistenza.⟪k:3⟫ O almeno, così credo che andarono le cose."

#: scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b7865b6d12cf15fee2f24119efda8224128f6060d65464820e9d1124449e009
#. default-sha256: 9ae9a04e7307ca5d488433549559f61434562f5d7a65a59c7fc8f761c3c50db4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was a slave for one grueling, torturous year.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No one treated me like a human "
"being.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was no one from the same part of the world as me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono stato uno schiavo per un anno—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫un periodo estenuante e straziante.⟪k:3⟫ "
"Nessuno mi trattava come un essere umano.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non c’era nessuno che venisse dalla mia stessa "
"terra."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ee96ad43127962ad0de2f4cbe35ab631a891df6d4749f32d5b8660ada76c9ba
#. default-sha256: a5a7ce54221e64a35197afaf98248383b8e1ed4e78544c9aec35f97df95dc8df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there was no one to come to my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E non c’era nessuno che venisse in mio aiuto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee0b7eaa142e4358911074ac5ecf8c9f8e5ce88c72943d2c8eedfa795ae4a425
#. default-sha256: 562b7992f4569011647c085572838b4085eb50340376abd20712e90b7c400950
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to be honest, I think I was happier ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ understanding what people were saying "
"about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma onestamente, credo che sarei stato più contento di ⟪k:1⟫non sapere⟪k:2⟫ cosa la gente "
"dicesse sul mio conto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fafdb4a9f290e806f037a4b4d976b6cf9232169d8b0965c7fb94557e8e7b5bc5
#. default-sha256: 68111ca1c17f1e8efa866a11c90f9a6eeb818226c52f81e55de00a75dc386b02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I was treated as something less than human,⟪k:1⟫the more I began to question "
"whether I really ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E più a lungo venivo trattato come qualcosa di non umano,⟪k:1⟫più mi domandavo se fossi "
"davvero tale."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4ab8464c278f528ea7e2f2ea0dac7441aa2710dbee0ca7e6dbff6217646c335
#. default-sha256: 0cd2bb080631f4aa5bad1695bab08f7e576ad056ca683249de2d4a1dc20517e0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was packed front to back with slaves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫or soon-to-be slaves, I suppose I "
"should say."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era pieno zeppo di schiavi—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o meglio, di persone che presto lo sarebbero diventate."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85a0d7dc7bb5fca659e7cb581e7fed12c6bae0580371f1db7f4b7cfff685b193
#. default-sha256: 0ab505627043a42670c31b1bbe5e0b474ca3f1b5d8a07b3f06a4263109704852
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But beyond that, I didn’t think much of it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t find it disturbing or "
"unpleasant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma al di là di questo, non la trovai disturbante o sgradevole..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9586f28b349f6975fa8c9a3ffba8c6edb38f39bbbe5ac3ec7a0bd383870060ce
#. default-sha256: 7b1b3e78d62121944746a14cb20abf5f49a1cdfc7accf4f7ca5ecf3b9d6d1173
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At my question, the girl turned her head up to look at me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Surprise crossed her "
"face for a few brief seconds,⟪k:3⟫but that was her only reaction to my appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alla mia domanda, la ragazza sollevò lo sguardo verso di me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per un breve istante "
"il suo volto venne attraversato dalla sorpresa,⟪k:3⟫ma reagì così solo per via delle mie "
"sembianze."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c401bdf93266337553cd72f33abb8873872438074f2a4885a3b1a977d7869eb0
#. default-sha256: 453091df5bbfc43a6b6ce00d8cd1ad3c83349e66208c70382b6cf07a1fa57c1d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assume her thought process was roughly the same as mine, so she felt no need to fear me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Presumo che il suo processo mentale fu più o meno simile al mio, perciò non aveva bisogno di "
"temermi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13ebd0eee11f0478bc9f7e49a6156afea4a944e43665e5123c6bbfb4da2c0959
#. default-sha256: 7d2b2d03a8ca2a37edd0334dc6d073436bb558bffc69c2c9b43dff7e01a539ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sad because I didn’t get the chance to show my gratitude to people very dear to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono triste perché non ho avuto l’opportunità di mostrare la mia gratitudine alle persone a "
"cui volevo bene."

#: scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3caeb12f68c03810576bc3db738744e8e0304dbd15890a37f0e39ba15012691
#. default-sha256: 2ae4ee6e8353ddc019b8da3b6944ebdaf34d546907e892ade3d8e988da80d620
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her voice, despite being soft, cut through the crying and wailing of the other slaves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫la sua voce, sebbene fosse delicata, sovrastava i pianti e i lamenti degli altri schiavi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46cadc76ad8fca997597b98b588b0c380aa6d1de6581380505a1e407930d78b2
#. default-sha256: bdd0e202e441014968920d6d3719ba3726cce1786bbbb934741eed80f7bd57e5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I pictured it like... ⟪k:1⟫a single patch of clear water in the middle of a swamp,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La immaginavo come... ⟪k:1⟫una singola chiazza di acqua limpida nel bel mezzo di una palude,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b8ce5ce36248b3ec9cae77463a226d780427ebbf5747d1193731729ac94c6d9
#. default-sha256: c32e49c15398a659fdb6d90d71371ddd38092f285fb486f8fc48dbd7a52a3234
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll apologize... ⟪k:1⟫anything!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Chiedo perdono... ⟪k:1⟫per qualunque cosa!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1811f75d3f4e2e81c3afd5e1515602c13ac3341aa9d80353b155fb66b99948b1
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1133a022a8709bb476a08eace8175d05685378a4e3bcde05a0a98bcf834bfd19
#. default-sha256: b87665d11429f37897c48cb1f4e2e3cab99c8be152b3993532248f379dd553dd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahahaha!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1cef80556c07ba2103eec1f24e39e81b07f340380a3e3b7580edd19b1995917
#. default-sha256: 952b7f28ee1e7f2f3eb03ed123ce7f60134a786008b2b7d6c6547dfdfcbdc910
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Holding a sword in my hand felt amazingly... ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫right⟪k:8⟫."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Whatever work I once did must have required me to use a blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La sensazione di tenere una spada in mano mi sembrò... ⟪k:6⟫"
"incredibilmente ⟪k:7⟫giusta⟪k:8⟫.⟪k:9⟫ Qualunque lavoro abbia fatto prima di allora, doveva aver "
"richiesto l’uso di un’arma come quella."

#: scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d509ac10b4c616487cfe9a2d04997e6728ec6b4f6d6f696f55081430e382f3f
#. default-sha256: 06f920813f0d5ae1839b97ceec8665841160dd2aeff309580cabc618b613947c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dead bodies sprawled out around me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Corpses I had made. Lives I had snuffed out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tutt’intorno a me erano distesi i loro cadaveri.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Corpi che ⟪k:3⟫io⟪k:4⟫ avevo "
"abbattuto. Vite che ⟪k:5⟫io⟪k:6⟫ avevo estinto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b39e89dc08c403bda29259c7e51eafeb67ccf6c36c703c6a3540a3850f9d30d
#. default-sha256: cd4ef81d5ddcd51e6f1c28185d171b239afa6a18959f10b9766caa5889637c02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t have the words to describe the high it gave me killing those men, the power I felt "
"over them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ho parole per descrivere l’euforia che provai nell’uccidere quegli uomini, il potere che "
"avvertii nel dominarli."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3646ab08b4243d10a062c431d090b617e1451a81f546c9a89b102c392687f8cd
#. default-sha256: 57ef4b2fb22c6b237f0f67cd365a6b9ca31a8fe4915f8ec9578704109d45b22d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was driven mad by the stench of blood filling the air.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, it just drew out what "
"was always there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il tanfo del sangue che riempiva l’aria mi aveva condotto alla follia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...No, aveva "
"solo richiamato ciò che avevo dentro da sempre."

#: scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14fe06b4e7390beef9744bd45b6d4e116d30e963d32322687d802e4133cdfc57
#. default-sha256: d669b0929f9915aeb7002b81a9d6f9adc9eedb49562f661d36f8245558c0e712
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I weren’t already deranged,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se non fossi già stato uno squilibrato,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E30A0CCB_D763_4642_86A5_DE4025B02443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76e81ad83885556db883d5a1c452f663a7cefd2467a81475f318bb267ad27702
#. default-sha256: 9e7f78303b86cc32923ef936100f166dc7b515d8e061d09bd038fd7851b829bd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E30A0CCB_D763_4642_86A5_DE4025B02443"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hey. You. Unlock my shackles for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ehi, tu. Toglimi le manette."

