#: scenario8:scenario8_30A39052_C8A3_4A9B_8C97_41A807382651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21c3c5c44e978c393f4a147226faa9c814a824421dc8f6f93b13f2d80e0ce983
