msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A couple days later, I made my way out to the location the lord had given me—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a "
"small cottage by a lake, where the witch was said to live."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un paio di giorni più tardi, mi diressi al posto indicato dal lord—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫una "
"piccola casetta vicino al lago, dove si diceva vivesse la strega."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90E21DF5_6FD8_48ED_9D6C_FFCC54475EC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63ee9e97ca1b97800da2d87f29829206685220a595a103e57f10a3796d1a10e1
